lāh when there came the command of your Lord. And they did not increase them in other than ruin.","j":12,"h":24,"s":11,"a":101,"sd":null},{"k":"11:102","t":"And thus is the seizure of your Lord when He seizes the cities while they are committing wrong. Indeed, His seizure is painful and severe.","j":12,"h":24,"s":11,"a":102,"sd":null},{"k":"11:103","t":"Indeed in that is a sign for those who fear the punishment of the Hereafter. That is a Day for which the people will be collected, and that is a Day [which will be] witnessed.","j":12,"h":24,"s":11,"a":103,"sd":null},{"k":"11:104","t":"And We do not delay it except for a limited term.","j":12,"h":24,"s":11,"a":104,"sd":null},{"k":"11:105","t":"The Day it comes no soul will speak except by His permission. And among them will be the wretched and the prosperous.","j":12,"h":24,"s":11,"a":105,"sd":null},{"k":"11:106","t":"As for those who were [destined to be] wretched, they will be in the Fire. For them therein is [violent] exhaling and inhaling.","j":12,"h":24,"s":11,"a":106,"sd":null},{"k":"11:107","t":"[They will be] abiding therein as long as the heavens and the earth endure, except what your Lord should will. Indeed, your Lord is an effecter of what He intends.","j":12,"h":24,"s":11,"a":107,"sd":null},{"k":"11:108","t":"And as for those who were [destined to be] prosperous, they will be in Paradise, abiding therein as long as the heavens and the earth endure, except what your Lord should will - a bestowal uninterrupted.","j":12,"h":24,"s":11,"a":108,"sd":null}],"juz":12,"hizb":24,"surahs":[11],"sajdah":false}